      322.97,
      401.9,
      394.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 36 of 2013 ishereby amended in subsection (1) of that section, by thesubstitution in paragraph (b) of that subsection, for the words\u201cdoes not exceed rupees one thousand two hundred seventyeight billion\u201d, of the words \u201cdoes not exceed rupees onethousand four hundred seventy eight billion\u201d.",
